  <item>
    <title>EP20. 评《超辉夜姬》：No Ending的时代</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a9be0fc8cdeb38c200d828</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a9be0fc8cdeb38c200d828</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Mar 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>由山下清悟监督、网飞播出的动画电影《超辉夜姬》，自公开以来收获了大量关注。虽然最被粉丝津津乐道的是片中女女关系性的描绘，但在此之外，本片在空间表现、漫符演技、打戏作画和主题思想层面，又有哪些值得评价的方面？我们和电台老朋友VonXXGhost以及库拉一起讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：ENA（bilibili</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/2740988" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/2740988"><span>@岩鳥エナ</span></a><span>）、钻石（bilibili</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1735250" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1735250"><span>@SFLSNZYN</span></a><span>，微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/7825668380" data-url="https://weibo.com/7825668380"><span>@SFLSNZYN-Mk-III</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：VonXXGhost、库拉</span></p><span></span><p><span>地底人电台bilibili账号：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1051095135" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1051095135"><span>@地底人动漫电台</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">00:03:21</a> 主播和嘉宾打分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">00:08:24</a> 现实空间的演技作画</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">00:18:35</a> MOBA游戏在日本的现况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1618">00:26:58</a> 赛博空间设计与细田守有何不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2345">00:39:05</a> CG预览对打戏作画的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">00:41:44</a> 从MV化到PV化的影像设计趋势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">00:48:40</a> 续写经典结尾不仅是为了Happy Ending</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3178">00:52:58</a> No Ending的绝望与希望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4224">01:10:24</a> 虚拟和现实的边界逐渐模糊，虚拟反攻现实，是当下的时代命题</span></p><span></span><p><span>【片单】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>夏日大作战（2009）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>命运石之门（2011）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>辉夜姬物语（2013）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>夜樱四重奏 花之歌（2013）</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61a7a61490e462aca0ea1397" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61a7a61490e462aca0ea1397"><span>你的名字</span></a><span>（2016）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>ISLAND（2018）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>辉夜大小姐想让我告白 第一季ED（2019）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>英雄联盟2019赛季宣传片（2019）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>知晓天空之蓝的人啊（2019）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>咒术回战 第一季OP（2020）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>薄明之翼（2020）</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/632099cc8212a6185470e59c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/632099cc8212a6185470e59c"><span>龙与雀斑公主</span></a><span>（2021）</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62020d104675a08411f51cb6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62020d104675a08411f51cb6"><span>地球外少年少女</span></a><span>（2022）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>派对浪客诸葛孔明（2022）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>莉可丽丝（2022）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>福星小子 OP1（2022）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>夜晚的水母不会游泳（2024）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>身为VTuber的我因为忘记关台而成了传说（2024）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>深夜重拳（2024）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>住在拔作岛上的我该如何是好？ OP（2025）</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698f5e6c4dd75b1c0e7c17c0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698f5e6c4dd75b1c0e7c17c0"><span>百米。</span></a><span>（2025）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Fate/strange Fake（2026）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>明日边缘（2026）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>相反的你和我（2026）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【延伸阅读】</span></p><span></span><p><span>地底人电台EP06. 别对「映像作家」出手！ </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62cc369964f141ad815010de" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62cc369964f141ad815010de"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《百米。》上映会，沓名健一评价 </span><a href="https://weibo.com/6619126440/Qru1pBD3P" data-url="https://weibo.com/6619126440/Qru1pBD3P"><span>weibo.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>「ray」官方MV </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1dc61BDEvL" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1dc61BDEvL"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【初音ミク】メルト（Melt） CPK! Remix【ryo（supercell）】 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1U1BfBgEcs" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1U1BfBgEcs"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【媒体信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>画师：肉機械</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：tl</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：ryo (supercell) feat. かぐや（夏吉ゆうこ）、月見ヤチヨ（早見沙織） - ワールドイズマイン CPK! Remix</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：月見ヤチヨ（早見沙織） - 星降る海</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/618cf6dc51faf40f83f54abb/ljakM4eKgP5Wjqugm7R1v6TSi7xo.m4a" length="89209725" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:31:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhrVb1h1rpr6ghqKg2lVceQ-jkOS.png"/>
