  <item>
    <title>EP19. 评《百米。》：10秒钟对人的异化</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698f5e6c4dd75b1c0e7c17c0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698f5e6c4dd75b1c0e7c17c0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Feb 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（本期片头BGM音量较小，请注意音量调节）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们请到鱼丰漫画爱好者TOTOLO和马拉松跑者一山同学，一期聊一聊短跑题材动画电影《百米。》。在鱼丰的原作基础上，动画改编做出了哪些取舍？转描作画又为作品带来了什么样的质感？我们展开了深入讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：钻石（bilibili</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1735250" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1735250"><span>@SFLSNZYN</span></a><span>，微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/7825668380" data-url="https://weibo.com/7825668380"><span>@SFLSNZYN-Mk-III</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：TOTOLO、一山同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>地底人电台bilibili账号：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1051095135" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1051095135"><span>@地底人动漫电台</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">00:05:47</a> 主播和嘉宾打分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">00:10:15</a> 对剧情删减的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">00:27:35</a> 藤坚和小宫的价值观冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2113">00:35:13</a> 从阳光大男孩到那场大雨，高中篇简直就是一部青春电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">00:41:32</a> 离开校园、走向社会是近年运动漫画的大趋势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2809">00:46:49</a> 说教是鱼丰绝对不会改的特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3160">00:52:40</a> 对跑步场景动画制作的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4260">01:11:00</a> 藤坚的两次跌落谷底</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5015">01:23:35</a> 《百米。》和《蓦然回首》的同构</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5305">01:28:25</a> 运动题材作品同类比较</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5754">01:35:54</a> 运动员心理问题疏解，教练不能缺席</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期片单】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>灌篮高手（1993-1996）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>排球少年（2014- ）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>伤物语（2016-2017）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>强风吹拂（2018-2019）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>蓦然回首（2024）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>关于地球的运动（2024-2025）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>金牌得主（2025- ）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【媒体信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>画师：肉機械</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：tl</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：堤博明 - Starts to Rain</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：Official髭男dism - らしさ</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/618cf6dc51faf40f83f54abb/lhBhRfccpuY2Im25hnlIv3clV7nc.m4a" length="107659976" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:50:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjrv7yx6pPBVsm3o8sKWQCxz0D4f.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Chat12. 《弹珠汽水瓶里的千岁同学》与校园轻改动画的现在 feat.甚谁</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6968cf7b109824f9e1a51c95</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6968cf7b109824f9e1a51c95</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Jan 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">00:01:40</a> 对《弹珠汽水瓶里的千岁同学》的整体评价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">00:14:51</a> 「这本轻小说真厉害！」是个什么奖？含金量怎么样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">00:24:50</a> 文库就是轻小说的厂牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2061">00:34:21</a> 2026年轻厉冠军《玩乐关系》介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2369">00:39:29</a> 轻改动画哪家强，反正别摊上project No.9</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2906">00:48:26</a> 轻小说作者写动画剧本，是利还是弊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3536">00:58:56</a> 轻小说和轻文学有哪些区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3961">01:06:01</a> 青春校园题材轻小说的脉络</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4476">01:14:36</a> 校园如何成为箱庭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4870">01:21:10</a> 特立独行的男主为什么不再流行了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6006">01:40:06</a> 轻改动画还会繁荣下去，静待下一个盲盒</span></p><span></span><p><span>延伸阅读</span></p><span></span><p><span>甚谁，新海诚新作来袭！深度揭秘他引领的文化新潮流，动画学术趴 </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5hMChkcr27R8SSwpMdAoDA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5hMChkcr27R8SSwpMdAoDA"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/618cf6dc51faf40f83f54abb/lvqPsuGIbunTnstiTtYAnsBx1Xdh.m4a" length="101880126" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:44:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi3taxT2i9WCSFMVW4gDVTdxl61b.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP18. 《电锯人 蕾塞篇》的圆形政治学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/695aa972463a0f9174d9fb01</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">695aa972463a0f9174d9fb01</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Jan 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期《电锯人 蕾塞篇》的影评里，我们把目光投向了一个容易被观众忽视的元素——不断出现在画面里的圆形。OP结束后的日本国旗、路边堆积的水泥管、玛奇玛的咖啡杯，以及片尾蕾塞倒在地上形成的血珀……这些充斥在镜头里却被巧妙隐藏起来的圆形，与主线故事之间存在什么联系，又能引申出怎样的解读空间？我们和嘉宾一条同学一起探讨。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：ENA（bilibili</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/2740988" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/2740988"><span>@岩鳥エナ</span></a><span>）、钻石（bilibili</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1735250" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1735250"><span>@SFLSNZYN</span></a><span>，微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/7825668380" data-url="https://weibo.com/7825668380"><span>@SFLSNZYN-Mk-III</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：一条同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>地底人电台bilibili账号：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1051095135" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1051095135"><span>@地底人动漫电台</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">00:01:00</a> 影片制作团队介绍和打分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">00:05:23</a> 藤本树是一个通俗作家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">00:16:40</a> 蕾塞葬毙的血珀为什么是圆形</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">00:25:40</a> 日本电影中的红色主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2538">00:42:18</a> 日本文学作品里的男性主角为什么总是无法成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2908">00:48:28</a> 玛奇玛的监视与现代管理社会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4604">01:16:44</a> 蕾塞篇的作画表现</span></p><span></span><p><span>【延伸阅读】</span></p><span></span><p><span>学级委员一条同学，蕾塞篇是圆形的电影 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1148681208010375169" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1148681208010375169"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【图片资料】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvCCJeU1-VwyVKwBzD12YWB_sGra.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>OP后第一个镜头，飘扬的日本国旗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liNMURkovXubJ5zp0dmvetJ6Yjpk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>影片结尾，蕾塞倒在血珀中，血珀形成一个完美的圆形</span></p><span></span><p><span>【媒体信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>画师：肉機械</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：钻石</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：米津玄師 - IRIS OUT</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：米津玄師、宇多田ヒカル - JANE DOE</span></p>]]></description>
