    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">00:01:45</a> 斋藤环的出版背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">00:06:22</a> 斋藤环的精神分析方法有什么不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">00:12:31</a> 日本御宅族的诞生过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">00:17:38</a> 宫崎勤事件，御宅族风评被害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">00:24:05</a> 《新世纪福音战士》让御宅族重新获得大众评价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">00:28:01</a> 30年来御宅族生存环境的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">00:43:10</a> 大泽真幸《御宅族论》简要介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3543">00:59:03</a> 从媒介环境理解战斗美少女题材为何在日本兴盛</span></p><span></span><p><span>地底人电台×屋顶现视研联动节目</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672f8bdbf373fe5d4df8c9a5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672f8bdbf373fe5d4df8c9a5"><span>Chat05. 日本00年代动漫批评给今天的我们带来哪些启示 feat.夜深人静</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681b6f90db57cd35f70ace57" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681b6f90db57cd35f70ace57"><span>Chat08. 再谈日本00年代动漫批评，「二次元」如何与「后现代」产生交集 feat.夜深人静、天坑</span></a></p>]]></description>
