    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>山田尚子监督的最新动画长片《你的颜色》2月21日登陆国内院线。在这部乐队题材的作品里，我们看到了许多山田尚子作品里经常出现的熟悉元素，也看到了一些新意。正如作为作品主轴的宁静祷文所说的那样，山田尚子的身上或许也有改变之物与不变之物。在这个日新月异的动画业界里，一位女性创作者能保持自己的创作自主性，实属难得。本期节目，两位主播和嘉宾红白、塔塔君一起，谈了谈我们各自心目中的山田尚子，以及对她未来创作的期许。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：ENA（bilibili</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/2740988" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/2740988"><span>@岩鳥エナ</span></a><span>）、钻石（bilibili</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1735250" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1735250"><span>@SFLSNZYN</span></a><span>，微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/7825668380" data-url="https://weibo.com/7825668380"><span>@SFLSNZYN-Mk-III</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：红白、塔塔君</span></p><span></span><p><span>地底人电台bilibili账号：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1051095135" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1051095135"><span>@地底人动漫电台</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">00:01:45</a> 内地院线删减情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">00:09:16</a> 因为各种原因辍学，在日本是很容易理解的行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">00:18:56</a> 如何看待本片的宗教元素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1644">00:27:24</a> 山田尚子的箱庭描写有无变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2127">00:35:27</a> 凸子的角色塑造</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2443">00:40:43</a> 结尾是否讲得太满？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2811">00:46:51</a> 从19世纪美术史解读本片的主要元素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3572">00:59:32</a> 日吉子老师的定位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3784">01:03:04</a> 对山田尚子未来创作的期待</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期片单】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>轻音少女（2009-2010）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>轻音少女 剧场版（2011）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>中二病也要谈恋爱ED1「INSIDE IDENTITY」（2012）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>玉子市场（2013）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>玉子爱情故事（2014）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>声之形（2017）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>恶魔人crybaby（2018）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>莉兹与青鸟（2018）</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61deb42919e8465da2f8f641" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61deb42919e8465da2f8f641"><span>剧场版 少女☆歌剧 Revue Starlight</span></a><span>（2021）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>平家物语（2021）</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62020d104675a08411f51cb6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62020d104675a08411f51cb6"><span>地球外少年少女</span></a><span>（2022）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>纪念花园（2024）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>金牌得主（2025）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>实拍电影</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>幸福的拉扎罗（2018）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【媒体信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>画师：肉機械</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：tl</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：しろねこ堂 - 水金地火木土天アーメン</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：Mr.Children - in the pocket</span></p>]]></description>
